{"zh":[{"start":0.13,"end":4.3,"text":"全球降水观测（GPM）任务观测到了飓风何塞和玛丽亚，"},{"start":4.32,"end":8.5,"text":"提供数据，帮助更好地理解和预报强风暴。"},{"start":8.52,"end":12.68,"text":"随着玛丽亚发展，降雨形态变得圆而对称。"},{"start":21.08,"end":25.26,"text":"9 月 18 日，玛丽亚开始迅速增强。"},{"start":25.28,"end":29.44,"text":"在增强期间，GPM 能看到云层下面，发现眼墙里有很高的风暴云。"},{"start":42.04,"end":46.21,"text":"GPM 捕捉到飓风何塞时，风暴结构正因为和高空低压槽相互作用而改变。"},{"start":46.23,"end":50.38,"text":"这让空气下沉变干，抑制了给飓风供能的雷暴。"}],"de":[],"en":[{"start":0.13,"end":4.3,"text":"The Global Precipitation (GPM) mission observed Hurricanes Jose and Maria,","words":[["The","这"],["Global","全球"],["Precipitation","降水"],["(GPM)","（GPM）"],["mission","任务"],["observed","观测到"],["Hurricanes","飓风"],["Jose","何塞"],["and","和"],["Maria,","玛丽亚"]]},{"start":4.32,"end":8.5,"text":"providing data to better understand and forecast intense storms.","words":[["providing","提供"],["data","数据"],["to","去"],["better","更好"],["understand","理解"],["and","和"],["forecast","预报"],["intense","强"],["storms.","风暴"]]},{"start":8.52,"end":12.68,"text":"As Maria developed, the rain pattern became circular and symmetric.","words":[["As","随着"],["Maria","玛丽亚"],["developed,","发展"],["the","这"],["rain","降雨"],["pattern","形态"],["became","变得"],["circular","圆的"],["and","和"],["symmetric.","对称的"]]},{"start":21.08,"end":25.26,"text":"On September 18, Maria began to rapidly intensify.","words":[["On","在"],["September","九月"],["18,","18"],["Maria","玛丽亚"],["began","开始"],["to","去"],["rapidly","迅速"],["intensify.","增强"]]},{"start":25.28,"end":29.44,"text":"During intensification, GPM was able to see beneath the clouds, revealing tall storms in the eyewall.","words":[["During","在…期间"],["intensification,","增强"],["GPM","GPM"],["was","曾"],["able","能够"],["to","去"],["see","看到"],["beneath","下面"],["the","这"],["clouds,","云层"],["revealing","揭示"],["tall","高"],["storms","风暴"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["eyewall.","眼墙"]]},{"start":42.04,"end":46.21,"text":"At the time GPM caught Hurricane Jose, the storm structure changed as it interacted with an upper level trough of low pressure.","words":[["At","在"],["the","这"],["time","时候"],["GPM","GPM"],["caught","捕捉到"],["Hurricane","飓风"],["Jose,","何塞"],["the","这"],["storm","风暴"],["structure","结构"],["changed","改变"],["as","当"],["it","它"],["interacted","相互作用"],["with","与"],["an","一个"],["upper","高"],["level","层"],["trough","槽"],["of","的"],["low","低"],["pressure.","气压"]]},{"start":46.23,"end":50.38,"text":"This caused the air to sink and dry, inhibiting the thunderstorms that fuel the hurricane.","words":[["This","这"],["caused","导致"],["the","这"],["air","空气"],["to","去"],["sink","下沉"],["and","和"],["dry,","变干"],["inhibiting","抑制"],["the","这"],["thunderstorms","雷暴"],["that","那"],["fuel","供能"],["the","这"],["hurricane.","飓风"]]}]}